        "title": "Itera sugli array",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 127604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esiste un modo semplice per scorrere tutti gli elementi di un array usando un ciclo <code>for</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(score)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Four executions",
            "id": 127605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per eseguire un ciclo sugli elementi dell'array <code>finalScores</code>, scriviamo <code>for</code>, una variabile come <code>score</code>, la parola <code>in</code> e l'array <code>finalScores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(score)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>score</code> e poi <code>in</code>, <code>finalScores</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Length",
            "id": 127606,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il ciclo verrà eseguito per tanti elementi quanti ce ne sono nell'array. In questo caso vedremo quattro elementi nella console scrivendo <code>print(score)</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(score)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"77\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>print(score)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "for",
            "id": 127607,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variabile prima di <code>in</code> contiene il valore dell'elemento della lista su cui si trova attualmente il ciclo. Qui useremo <code>artist</code> come variabile.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>artist</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 127608,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si esegue un ciclo su un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Con un ciclo for</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Con un'istruzione <code>print()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con un ciclo for.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 127609,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" studentGrades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" studentGrades {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(grade)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"A\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"A-\"</code> e infine da <code>\"C\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Questo codice non visualizzerà nulla nella console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"A\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"A-\"</code> e infine da <code>\"C\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 127610,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(singer)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il ciclo for-in è scritto in modo errato </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è niente di sbagliato in questo codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il ciclo for-in è scritto in modo errato .</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 127611,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(console)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> e <code>\"Xbox\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non viene visualizzato nulla nella console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> e <code>\"Xbox\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 127612,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un'istruzione <code>print()</code> all'interno del ciclo for e visualizza <code>item</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(item)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items:\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>item</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 127613,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assembla un ciclo for con l'elenco <code>supplies</code> in Swift.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pencil&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"pencil\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>in</code> e infine <code>supplies</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 127614,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi <code>for</code> per completare il ciclo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dataPoints = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" data \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dataPoints {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(data + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"38\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"100\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"100\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
